[[File:RocketGrootVol.2.PNG|{{AltFloat}}|Rocket's face disfigures during the jumps]]
{{Quote|I know you steal [[Anulax Batteries|batteries]] you don't need and you push away anyone who's willing to put up with you, because just a little bit of love reminds you of how big and empty that hole inside you actually is.|[[Yondu Udonta]] to Rocket|Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2}}
Despite of [[Yondu Udonta]]'s warnings of going further many jump points for health reasons, the group began to suffer some disfigurements with each orifices of their bodies are starting come apart. Rocket and Groot started to scream loudly as they go to many jump points to reach over to [[Ego]].
